Aaj 24 December 2025 hai. Jab poori duniya jashn ki taiyari mein hai, Bangladesh ki fizaon mein ek ajeeb sa sannata hai.
​Waqt ki sui ne jaise ek bhayanak mod le liya hai. Tareekh badal gayi, magar halaat bad se badtar hote ja rahe hain.
​Dhaka ki in andheri galiyon mein umeed ki lau dheemi pad rahi hai, aur darr ka saya gehra hota ja raha hai.
​Mobile ki screen par aati har nayi khabar dil dehla dene wali hai. Log darr ke maare apne gharon mein qaid hain.
​In aankhon ne wo dekha hai jise shabd bayaan nahi kar sakte. Ek aisi aag, jo sab kuch raakh karne par aamaada hai.
​Bheed ka koi chehra nahi hota, aur jab bheed kanoon apne haath mein le le, toh insaniyat dum todne lagti hai.
​Wo manzar itna khaufnaak tha ki dekhne walon ki rooh kaanp gayi. Ek insaan ko zinda jala dena... ye kaisa insaaf hai?
​Sadak par bikhre ye nishaan us maut ki gawahi de rahe hain, jo nafrat aur junoon ki wajah se aayi.
​Aasman mein uthta ye kala dhuaan sirf aag ka nahi, balki hamare samaj ke girte hue moral values ka hai.
​Nafrat ki is aag mein sabse pehle insaniyat jalti hai. Bangladesh aaj isi jalan ko mehsoos kar raha hai.
​Siyasat aur hinsa ke is khel mein hamesha masoom hi piste hain. In aansuon ka hisaab kaun dega?
​Toote hue sheeshe aur bikhra hua bharosa... ab ise sametne mein shayad sadiyan lag jayengi.
​Kuch log ab bhi andhere mein roshni dhoond rahe hain. Ye mombattiyan sirf shok nahi, balki insaaf ki pukaar hain.
​Duniya bhar ke akhbaar is ghatna se bhare pade hain. Har koi sawal puch raha hai—Kya hum waqayi 2025 mein jee rahe hain?
​Umeed hai ki is raakh se phir shanti ka phool khilega. Par aaj ka din, hamesha ek kaale din ke taur par yaad rakha jayega."Copyright 2025 OpenAI

